{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6a3cc66294f3211413856569de61f0e7ac1f9e31646ce7945b51d8f9ad77ab77","ja":"机にむかい、誰かにむけて","zh":"面向书桌，写给某个人","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3f978879547e60639428e7357250be5cec118609abf39e8189aa1d77ad271469","ja":"……ということで、実際に残酷な掟がある地域も、\n昔はあったみたいなんです。","zh":"……也就是说，过去似乎确实有些地区存在过残酷的习俗。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"aa58e8bad4536fe47cbc491daee4770f79f1f9bea86f0e8fa0783839ad76ddd3","ja":"だからお客さんには、フィクションじゃなくって\n現実の出来事のように感じてもらえたら最高ですね。","zh":"所以，要是能让客人觉得这不是虚构，而是现实中发生的事情，那就再好不过了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"35e43fa744f901e196be1c1e841a176242c02749fa7c325ee212a455ad815923","ja":"はぁ～……怖い話だね～……。","zh":"哈啊～……真是个可怕的故事呢～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"444454232ba6289b26692e5d29d999e90b1c2649dd1ec56c205686f88f99865a","ja":"それに村長って、とっても大変な役割なんだねぇ。\n偉いのには、それだけの理由があったんだわ……。","zh":"而且，村长是个非常辛苦的职位呢。之所以那么了不起，也是有原因的啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9ddf1127719909082c73fade4ee2c6c5ae5747df4dd176f5bb6306d50c626636","ja":"律子さん、とっても参考になったよぉ。\nおかげで、役に入り込めそうだべさ。","zh":"律子小姐，真的给了我很大的参考哦。\n托你的福，我感觉自己能进入角色了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"40996b95780b24cc554ac6864db53c1e7d9513ee7a979c190847bc613251fc23","ja":"たまきも、お芝居の内容、わかってきたぞ！","zh":"环也逐渐明白戏剧的内容了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ecd82d342cce642409fd39b552ea1b0100e9bcc0535b6752b11a1e89b4d84ac8","ja":"りつこ、教えるのすっごく上手だね！\nありがとう♪","zh":"律子，你真的很擅长教人呢！\n谢谢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4ecc794a84d630d968d0317951182850d8b09deb911bb021bd6b04d58debbf1b","ja":"そう？　ふふ、ちゃんと伝わってよかったわ♪","zh":"是吗？呵呵，能好好传达出去真是太好了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"4638d89041d9bbea74cdff6d91d1c45d5bc102c4a77a72f6c2c1e358c7f70000","ja":"私も勉強させてもらったわ。本当にありがとう。\n資料をまとめるの、大変だったんじゃない？","zh":"我也从中学到了很多。真的谢谢你。\n整理资料很辛苦吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c3de5e97c6eaa98b88c129c4c566c96b615a2747eb489511ff19377ff939de6b","ja":"それ、私も思いました！　自分じゃ絶対読めない本の\n内容を、ギュギュ～っと詰めてもらった感じやんな？","zh":"我也是这么想的！感觉就像把我自己绝对读不懂的书的内容，满满当当地塞进来了，对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"be8126bd4b58873b8d298557c42d08b9fc5f734701c343cd9b7162673931194c","ja":"ふふ、みんなに喜んでもらえて何よりだわ♪\nあ、そうだ……私からも、環にお礼を言わせて？","zh":"呵呵，大家能感到开心就是最好的了♪\n啊，对了……也让我替自己向环道声谢吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"f7cb496d268636640cbbc449700bbaf89d59a5f932e4f4cec894d6a8e70c0bd3","ja":"ええっ、なんで？\nたまき、りつこに何もしてないよ？","zh":"诶，为什么？大神环什么都没对律子做呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"de1e3d12b02f2dce4189b674caead3e04d7c65550dd4fb2f4f1b61b845cdad91","ja":"自分のために読むのと、環にも理解してもらいたい、\nって思いながら読むのとは、全然違ったの。","zh":"为了自己读，和抱着也想让环理解的想法去读，完全不一样。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"b74b74fcf1bd13d62557c763891852749012b6cc965449b0d301793f3a6c4d62","ja":"重要なところはどこだろう、とか色々考えながら\n読んでたら、理解度がぐっと上がったわ。","zh":"一边思考着重要的地方在哪里之类的问题，阅读时理解程度一下子提高了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"678b6a88bef13f6525bb42344c2faad638f02b4f6ee106141791dd10b9403897","ja":"それに、人のためって意識があると\n勉強そのものが、いつもより楽しくなっちゃって♪","zh":"而且，一旦有了“这是为了别人”的意识，学习本身也会变得比平时更有趣♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"3cf910f117aa616ca305467ec7aff865bff4f9fb9bc66600cbf88ec5cc1b9ad1","ja":"わあっ、律子さん\nなんだか優しい先生みたいだねぇ。","zh":"哇，律子小姐，\n感觉就像一位温柔的老师呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"6f07ff29d8f251acf542ac9b2a0b70fd1ab188c41237e7439deae4fa16f30dc4","ja":"うん！　りつこが学校の先生に\nなってくれたら、たまき、勉強が楽しくなるかも！","zh":"嗯！要是律子能来当学校老师，环，学习可能会变得很有趣！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_989.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"2c6e329ef3623bc234f9cfc9651e7f9ed852ac11e4be5d038ae358bf93841906","ja":"ふふ、学校の先生はちょっと難しいけど……\nたまになら専属家庭教師になってあげるわよ♪","zh":"呵呵，学校老师有点难当，不过……\n偶尔的话，我可以当你的专属家庭教师哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
